D CARL HESS AS THE COMPANY'S NEW PRESIDENT AND NEXT CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER (CEO). HESS, WHO CURRENTLY SERVES AS WILLIS TOWERS WATSON'S HEAD OF INVESTMENT, RISK AND REINSURANCE BUSINESS SEGMENT, WILL IMMEDIATELY ASSUME THE PRESIDENT ROLE AND SUCCEED JOHN HALEY, UPON HIS RETIREMENT, AS CEO ON JANUARY 1, 2022."}